    "detailed_description": "<strong>Slide!</strong> is a top-down puzzle game where you control both the protagonist and the antagonist, whenever you move he moves alongside you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028840/extras/5b93725e857dabb3e21d98506c4f1254.poster.avif?t=1719331484\" width=256 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028840/extras/5b93725e857dabb3e21d98506c4f1254.webm?t=1719331484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Each stage has you thinking of new ways to defeat your opponent, as new items and hazards are introduced along the way.<br>You'll dodge spikes, pick up swords, get thrown around by arrows, and clash against angry man to defeat him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 20 Stages<br></li><li> Master levels for those who are up to a challenge beyond the main game<br></li><li> Catchy Soundtrack<br></li><li> Simple to understand Gameplay with challenging levels<br></li><li> Charming Graphics</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Slide!</strong> is a top-down puzzle game where you control both the protagonist and the antagonist, whenever you move he moves alongside you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028840/extras/5b93725e857dabb3e21d98506c4f1254.poster.avif?t=1719331484\" width=256 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028840/extras/5b93725e857dabb3e21d98506c4f1254.webm?t=1719331484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Each stage has you thinking of new ways to defeat your opponent, as new items and hazards are introduced along the way.<br>You'll dodge spikes, pick up swords, get thrown around by arrows, and clash against angry man to defeat him.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >the Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 20 Stages<br></li><li> Master levels for those who are up to a challenge beyond the main game<br></li><li> Catchy Soundtrack<br></li><li> Simple to understand Gameplay with challenging levels<br></li><li> Charming Graphics</li></ul>",
